    "name": "ParTrans-X",
    "description": "An efficient parallel framework called ParTrans-X is proposed for translating embedding methods. This framework addresses the limitation of these state-of-the-art methods—their time-consuming training process—by enabling them to be paralleled without locks using the distinguished structures of knowledge graphs. Experiments validate that ParTrans-X significantly speeds up the training process, accelerating it by more than an order of magnitude when tested on two datasets using typical translating embedding methods like TransE and TransH.",
